# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DESIGN PIPELINE - explicit ALLOWLIST, added 2026-08-05.
# covers/ is 82 files. Three of them (cover-letter.mjs, email-letter.mjs,
# email-preview.html) carry a real email address, and the rest are personal
# build scripts - favicons, party posters, Dispatch covers. None of that is
# the open-source contribution. The contribution is the ENGINE: the renderer,
# the deterministic floor, the coherence gate, the selector and the grid.
# Deny the folder, then name what may leave. A denylist would have to predict
# every future personal file; an allowlist cannot leak one by omission.
covers/*
!covers/_coherence.mjs
!covers/_contact-sheet.mjs
!covers/_critique.mjs
!covers/_fonts.mjs
!covers/_grid.mjs
!covers/_judge.mjs
!covers/_render.mjs
!covers/_select.mjs
!covers/_system.mjs
!covers/pipeline-diverge.mjs
!covers/pipeline-build.mjs
!covers/pipeline-ecosystem.mjs
!covers/pipeline-press.mjs

# Working assets: 80 files of debug renders and candidate crops, plus
# content-assets/pinterest/ - reference images saved from Pinterest. Those are
# third-party works with no licence and no attribution, so they must never be
# redistributed from a public repo. They are a private swipe file, not an asset.
content-assets/
